<http://data.silknow.org/event/ffc6d031-fb1e-370c-8d8d-d95ccc6fd35b>
        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Bought from Mrs C. D. Holland (with IS.98 and 100-1955) for £100.00\nMrs Holland was the executor of Mrs M. V. Roper Lumley-Holland. They had all been on loan to the museum from about 1880 from Major-General Lumley Holland.\n\nThis object then numbered 3413 IS was then shown in The Art of India and Pakistan 1947-8."@en ;
        ecrm:P22_transferred_title_to  <http://data.silknow.org/actor/f0577f91-f887-3019-bf88-f9e5ba019390> ;
        ecrm:P24_transferred_title_of  <http://data.silknow.org/object/3958838d-43e8-3701-9f6d-ee4889318e52> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Bought from Mrs C. D. Holland (with IS.98 and 100-1955) for £100.00\nMrs Holland was the executor of Mrs M. V. Roper Lumley-Holland. They had all been on loan to the museum from about 1880 from Major-General Lumley Holland.\n\nThis object then numbered 3413 IS was then shown in The Art of India and Pakistan 1947-8."@en .

